This project tests the object matter wave claimed in
Lee, Mun Seok (2026), "Digital to Wave: LGD In Situ Wave Memory-Human Wave Integrated Interface-Metaverse
Hologram- Wave Affective AI", Zenodo preprint (Part II), https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21947108
(concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21947107).
The preprint is distributed by its author under CC BY 4.0. No text, figures or other material from it are
redistributed here; its numbers are cited and used as inputs to an independent computation. Its author has
not reviewed or endorsed this software.

Companion: sparkainlp-x/digital-to-wave-2-thz-validity, which validity-checked the Part II human-wave
interface equations (dimensional error, impossible intensities, chi^(2) = 0 in bulk water), and
sparkainlp-x/digital-to-wave-2-diffraction, which falsified the THz readout by the Abbe diffraction
limit (readable capacity short by ~10^14-10^17). This module covers the section 3 matter-wave /
hologram gap those repos left open. No DOI exists for this package yet.
